Interview trick question ⚠️
“HttpClient supports progress, so it supports streaming, right?”
Correct answer:
“No. HttpClient reports download progress but still buffers the entire response. Streaming requires access to the response body as a stream, 
which is only available via Fetch API or native streams.”
====================================================================================================
Can HttpClient be used AT ALL in your POC?
✅ YES — but for a DIFFERENT use case
Valid HttpClient use cases:
File download with progress bar
Save to disk after full download
Small/medium files (<10MB)
❌ Not suitable for:
Huge files (100MB+)
Progressive rendering
Page-on-demand PDF viewing
