| Option                 | Why                                 |
| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `responseType: 'blob'` | PDF is binary data                  |
| `observe: 'events'`    | Emit multiple HTTP lifecycle events |
| `reportProgress: true` | Enable progress events              |

